[h2]Build 0.9.112[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Repair materials kept in storage buildings that hold items inside them (bookcases, outfit stands, and storage from other mods) were ignored by mend bills since build 0.9.111. They are counted again.
[*]Further reduced stutters when colonists look for mending work: materials that are on the map but forbidden, reserved or outside the bill's search radius no longer trigger a full search, and a material list that came up short is not searched for again on every other bench in the same moment.
[/list]
